//  17 Penyok (RU S), 18 Cross-Circle (RU D), 19 Parabola (RU C), 20 Hunt-Plex, 21 FireDot Duplex,
//  22 Boone and Crockett, 23 LR Varmint Hunter, 24 Wind-Plex, 25 MIL-XT, 26 MOA-XT, 27 Horus H59, 28 ACOG Chevron BDC
